&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第1章 豪迈自大的“白发罗刹”被地痞流氓狠狠攻击肚脐眼弱点后，屈辱败北&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第2章 女侠的弱点肚脐被彻底开发玩弄，三个流氓保留她的处女后轮番上阵玩弄身体，最后商讨把她卖给叛军&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第3章 女侠被打上脐钉，卖到叛军军营后，开始前期调教，精神羞辱后，被迫像母畜一样进食&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第4章 女侠被调教双乳，开发乳穴喷出乳汁，阎婆走后女侠又被两个士卒玩弄&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第5章 女侠被用工具和淫虫彻底改造开发肚脐穴，吸着大帅浓郁的鸡巴气味后彻底堕落为专属肚脐奴&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第6章 女侠正式面见大帅，被当成母畜一样鞭打，女侠主动深喉服侍后被灌满浓精&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第7章 女侠被医师闺蜜救出，仔细检查身体疗伤，随后计划杀回去刺杀大帅&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;(终章) 白衣独行破幽影，赤鞭一抖斩四煞&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>